{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"3a451c44-1f64-430f-b951-96d3a9d0a516","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The causes for both issues have been identified, resolved, tested, and documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-5ru7kz/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Causes\n\n1. **Prod Crash (`logs/prod-error.log`)**:\n   - In [`StoryLibrary.hide`](file:///tmp/h-5ru7kz/src/app.py#L53-L65), `hidden` was used as a bare attribute name in `UpdateExpression=\"SET hidden = :h, ...\"`.\n   - `hidden` is a DynamoDB reserved keyword. DynamoDB rejects bare reserved words in `UpdateExpression` and `ConditionExpression` with `ValidationException: Attribute name is a reserved keyword`.\n\n2. **Hidden Story Appearing in Public Feed on Staging (`logs/bug-report.md`)**:\n   - In [`StoryLibrary.feed`](file:///tmp/h-5ru7kz/src/app.py#L67-L80), `hidden` was listed as a bare attribute name in `ProjectionExpression=\"slug, title, hidden, published_at\"`.\n   - Unlike update/condition expressions, bare reserved keywords in a DynamoDB `ProjectionExpression` fail silently: DynamoDB omits the attribute from the returned items rather than throwing an error.\n   - Because `hidden` was omitted from scan results, `i.get(\"hidden\")` always returned `None`, allowing hidden stories to slip through `if not i.get(\"hidden\")`.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n- **[src/app.py](file:///tmp/h-5ru7kz/src/app.py)**: Applied `#alias` placeholders via `ExpressionAttributeNames` across all expressions (`publish`, `rename`, `hide`, `feed`, and `archive`).\n- **[tests/test_feed.py](file:///tmp/h-5ru7kz/tests/test_feed.py)**: Added regression tests verifying that `hide()` removes items from the feed, manually hidden records in DynamoDB are excluded by `feed()`, and `archive()` updates successfully.\n- **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-5ru7kz/ANSWER.md)**: Documented the root causes and preventative measures.\n","duration_seconds":60.768995,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":118160,"output_tokens":3580,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":171091,"total_tokens":121740}}}
